  "steps": [
    "Whisk the curd and besan with 3 cups of water until completely smooth and free of lumps.",
    "Pour into a heavy pot, add ginger paste, green chilli, jaggery and salt, and bring to a boil on medium heat, stirring constantly.",
    "Reduce the heat and simmer for 12-15 minutes until the raw besan smell is gone and the kadhi lightly thickens.",
    "In a small pan heat the ghee and add mustard seeds, cumin seeds, cloves, dried red chilli, hing and curry leaves.",
    "Pour the sizzling tempering over the kadhi and stir through.",
    "Garnish with coriander leaves and serve hot."
  ]
